  "translation": "O kɛra kalo wolonwula (7) na: Yishmael (Ismail), Netanya denkɛ, Elishama denkɛ, min bɔra masatigiya kisɛ la, na ni mɔgɔ tan ⟨את⟩ a ye; u ye ⟨את⟩ Gedalyahu (Gedaliya) gbɛ, a saera, ani ⟨את⟩ Yuda mɔgɔw ani ⟨את⟩ Kasdim minnu tun ye ⟨את⟩ a ye Mitspa.",
